# Lesson 31.6 - vertical excitations of all-trans butadiene: full TD-DFT (TDA switched off) with the
# range-separated hybrid CAM-B3LYP and def2-SVP, on the GFN2-xTB geometry made by lesson06_uvvis.py.
# ORCA 6.1.1:  orca 06_butadiene_tddft.inp > 06_butadiene_tddft.out   (one to a few minutes)
# Exercise: delete the line "TDA false" (ORCA then uses its default, TDA) and compare the bright state.
! CAM-B3LYP def2-SVP
%maxcore 1000
%tddft
  NRoots 5
  TDA false
end
* xyzfile 0 1 ../runs/31.6-polyenes/butadiene/xtbopt.xyz
